<title>PAKISTAN: Pakistani bourse to close for four days.</title>
<headline>Pakistani bourse to close for four days.</headline>
<dateline>KARACHI, Pakistan 1996-12-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Karachi Stock Exchange will remain closed for four days from Wednesday due to two local holidays and the Friday-Saturday weekend, an official of the exchange said on Tuesday.</p>
<p>The exchange will be shut on Wednesday for Pakistan's founder Mohammad Ali Jinnah's birthday and a religious holiday on Thursday. -- Karachi newsroom 9221-5685192</p>
